{"id": "EUVD-2026-76341", "enisaUuid": "b7cb9103-ddca-34c6-a9f8-02acc15fa297", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nplatform/x86: think-lmi: Free system certificate signatures\n\nMulti-certificate support also allows the system authentication object\nto store ->signature and ->save_signature, which leak when the driver is\nremoved. Free the signatures to avoid leaking memory.", "datePublished": "2026-09-11T19:43:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T08:46:43", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9c28adde051fe76a7754856d0a414ab89adcaa4d", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/abbcc0354108cf47a6055b951182bf73520d0363", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/abca989604f60fe29d7170431f819e28ec7d868a"], "aliases": ["GHSA-853p-rq52-958c", "CVE-2026-81018"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.16, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0863f414-9924-388e-bac9-0e3a48f44268", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "58f1bd45-4d23-3446-a741-7f567170508c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.13"}, {"id": "91531fed-20de-3037-bd5e-3bbf8c2f804b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "b6ddaa3b-6e25-30b8-9aa5-829afcdb8787", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5dcb5ef125907d09806509a9db8c6705041e0026 <abbcc0354108cf47a6055b951182bf73520d0363"}, {"id": "ba0bf409-593c-39aa-aa63-c9a4a642ef1f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.4"}, {"id": "d442abb0-7e58-3aea-b799-eb0e5ad56555", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.50"}, {"id": "daa3c595-37b1-3c4d-a727-9c2465efd131", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5dcb5ef125907d09806509a9db8c6705041e0026 <9c28adde051fe76a7754856d0a414ab89adcaa4d"},